chain.el.\n  iar-agent-utils requires only cl-lib, subr-x, iar-utils -- no\n  load-order cycle.\n- Alternative structural fix (iar-tool-call.el requires\n  iar-agent-utils) touches production load order -- NOT\n  recommended without Nacho (shared module, \"before all other\n  init.d modules\" comment).\n\n* NOTE\n\n- The warning is best-effort by design (condition-case demotes to\n  message; USAGE.log line is lost only in the standalone-test\n  context). Cosmetic, but worth fixing for clean test output.\n[t+02:48/60:00 c20/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_3aavoggd","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /root/i.ar/test/integration/"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[14:44:08] total 4\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root   26 Sep 18 14:02 .\ndrwxr-xr-x. 1 root root   22 Aug 30 05:24 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 root root 3990 Sep 18 14:02 test-infra.sh\n\n[t+03:07/60:00 c21/300]"}]
